Package: ddcbright
Version: 1.1
Section: base
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt5
Maintainer: Panagiotis Chaidos <phaidos@gmail.com>
Description: Brightness Control Application
 A system tray utility for controlling monitor brightness over DDC/CI.
 Requires the "monitorcontrol" Python package (pip install monitorcontrol);
 not packaged for apt, so run that once after installing.
